            <blockquote class="flex-1 text-lg font-medium text-navy leading-relaxed mt-2 mb-6">
              I've definitely seen a big improvement in story quality.
            </blockquote>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-teal/15 border-2 border-teal/30 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-teal-dark flex-shrink-0">TJ</div>
