            </blockquote>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-teal-light/15 border-2 border-teal-light/40 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-teal-light flex-shrink-0">BZ</div>
              <div>
                <p class="font-bold text-white">Brian Zompetti</p>
